sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant B as Backend
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    participant L as LLM Provider
    U->>F: Ask about current analysis
    F->>B: POST message action=ask
    B->>D: Persist ask message and run
    B->>D: Load latest validated analysis context
    Note over B: No fresh RAG call
    B->>L: question_answer request with reused context
    L-->>B: Answer and structured output
    B->>B: Validate bindings
    B->>D: Persist assistant response and completed run
    B-->>F: Updated thread

